<http://data.silknow.org/object/7aced209-51a8-3149-8fa3-0bf6eb1dfdb6/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Piece of uncut velvet and taffeta, printed in parts. At the bottom are five horizontal bands of uncut velvet with printed floral patterns in purple and other colours. These alternate with six narrow bands of taffeta with lace-like patterns in uncut pile. The upper part is plain taffeta. The taffeta is lilac throughout and the velvet is cream on white, except where it is printed."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/7aced209-51a8-3149-8fa3-0bf6eb1dfdb6> .

